sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FW as Firmware
    participant LM as Limine bootloader
    participant K as K1 kernel
    participant S as Serial port
    participant T as Test mode

    FW->>LM: Start boot from ISO
    LM->>LM: Load kernel ELF, build memory map, set up HHDM
    LM->>K: Jump to kernel entry (Limine protocol)
    K->>K: Switch to kernel-owned bootstrap stack
    K->>S: Print banner
    K->>K: Install IDT exception gates
    K->>K: Install GDT, TSS, double-fault IST
    K->>K: Parse memory map, init physical allocator
    K->>K: Inspect page tables (read only)
    K->>T: Run selected test mode
    T->>S: Print result markers
    K->>K: Halt
    Note over FW,T: Order summarises the reported slices 0G to 0L.<br/>Exact call order is not published here.
